-- title:
--   Pairwise coprime odd numbers in short windows (explicit window length)
-- statement:
--   Let $d, X, H$ and $A_i$ ($i < d$) be natural numbers with $A_i + H \le X$. If
--
--   $$H \ge 2^{\,4\,(\log_2(4(d(\log_2 X + 1) + 1)) + 2)^2}$$
--
--   (with integer binary logarithms), then there are pairwise coprime odd $s_i$ with $A_i < s_i \le A_i + H$.
--
--   In Lean:
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Sieve.exists_coprime_in_windows_of_pow_le (d X H : ℕ) (A : Fin d → ℕ)
